<title>USA: Mercantile Stores Co Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Mercantile Stores Co Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, Ohio 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter Results</p>
<p>	     For the Quarter and Thirty-Nine Weeks</p>
<p>	  Ended November 2, 1996 and October 28, 1995</p>
<p>			    Quarter Ended   Thirty-Nine Weeks Ended</p>
<p>				Nov 2,  Oct 28,     Nov 2,    Oct 28,</p>
<p>(unaudited-in-</p>
<p> thousands,		   1996     1995    1996(A)	1995</p>
<p>except per share data)</p>
<p> Total Revenues	 $727,741 $694,765 $2,042,677 $1,940,071</p>
<p>Costs, Expenses and</p>
<p>Other Income:</p>
<p>Cost of Goods Sold</p>
<p>(including occupancy</p>
<p>and central buying</p>
<p>  expenses)		495,379  470,813  1,416,275  1,366,736</p>
<p>Selling, General and</p>
<p>Administrative</p>
<p>  Expenses		 180,814  173,859    517,177    499,276</p>
<p> Interest Expense, net   2,387    3,265	7,023     11,179</p>
<p> Other Income	    (2,590)  (1,792)    (7,659)   (13,128)</p>
<p> Impairment Charge	     -	  -     12,000	    -</p>
<p>			     675,990  646,145  1,944,816  1,864,063</p>
<p>Income before</p>
<p>  Income Taxes	    51,751   48,620     97,861     76,008</p>
<p> Income Taxes	     20,663   19,410     39,068     30,344</p>
<p> Net Income		 31,088   29,210     58,793     45,664</p>
<p>Net Income</p>
<p>  Per Share		    .85	.79	 1.60	 1.24</p>
<p>Note: (A) - The 1996 thirty-nine weeks reflects a pre-tax charge totaling $12 million, or $.20 per share, attributable to the adoption of a new accounting standard related to the impairment of long-lived assets.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
